"body":"Bumps [twilio](https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node) from 3.66.1 to 4.20.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/releases\">twilio's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>4.20.0</h2>\n<h2><strong>Release Notes</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Api</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated service base url for connect apps and authorized connect apps APIs <strong>(breaking change)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Events</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Marked as GA</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Insights</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>decommission voice-qualitystats-endpoint role</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Numbers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Get Port In request api</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Taskrouter</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>jitter_buffer_size</code> param in update reservation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Trusthub</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add additional optional fields in compliance_tollfree_inquiry.json</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Verify</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>Tags</code> from Public Docs <strong>(breaking change)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://twilio.com/docs/libraries/reference/twilio-node/4.20.0/index.html\">Docs</a></strong></p>\n<h2>4.19.3</h2>\n<h2><strong>Release Notes</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Verify</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>VerifyEventSubscriptionEnabled</code> parameter to service create and update endpoints.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://twilio.com/docs/libraries/reference/twilio-node/4.19.3/index.html\">Docs</a></strong></p>\n<h2>4.19.0</h2>\n<h2><strong>Release Notes</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Library - Chore</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/966\">#966</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/966\">twilio/twilio-node#966</a>): upgraded semver versions. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/sbansla\"><code>@​sbansla</code></a>!</li>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/964\">#964</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/964\">twilio/twilio-node#964</a>): added feature request issue template. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/sbansla\"><code>@​sbansla</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Accounts</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated Safelist metadata to correct the docs.</li>\n<li>Add Global SafeList API changes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Api</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added optional parameter <code>CallToken</code> for create participant api</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/blob/main/CHANGES.md\">twilio's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>[2023-12-14] Version 4.20.0</h2>\n<p><strong>Api</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated service base url for connect apps and authorized connect apps APIs <strong>(breaking change)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Events</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Marked as GA</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Insights</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>decommission voice-qualitystats-endpoint role</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Numbers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Get Port In request api</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Taskrouter</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>jitter_buffer_size</code> param in update reservation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Trusthub</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add additional optional fields in compliance_tollfree_inquiry.json</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Verify</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>Tags</code> from Public Docs <strong>(breaking change)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[2023-12-01] Version 4.19.3</h2>\n<p><strong>Verify</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>VerifyEventSubscriptionEnabled</code> parameter to service create and update endpoints.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[2023-11-17] Version 4.19.2</h2>\n<p><strong>Library - Chore</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/971\">#971</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/971\">twilio/twilio-node#971</a>): Update axios to 1.6 to pull in fix for CVE 2023 45857. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/kitu-apietila\"><code>@​kitu-apietila</code></a>!</li>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/963\">#963</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/963\">twilio/twilio-node#963</a>): Removing Test Related To Deprecated Endpoint - OAuth. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/KobeBrooks\"><code>@​KobeBrooks</code></a>!</li>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/958\">#958</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/958\">twilio/twilio-node#958</a>): twilio help changes. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/kridai\"><code>@​kridai</code></a>!</li>\n<li>[PR <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/issues/978\">#978</a>](<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/978\">twilio/twilio-node#978</a>): Removed LTS version. Thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/tiwarishubham635\"><code>@​tiwarishubham635</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Api</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Update documentation to reflect RiskCheck GA</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Messaging</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add tollfree edit_allowed and edit_reason fields</li>\n<li>Update Phone Number, Short Code, Alpha Sender, US A2P and Channel Sender documentation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Taskrouter</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add container attribute to task_queue_bulk_real_time_statistics endpoint</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Trusthub</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rename did to tollfree_phone_number in compliance_tollfree_inquiry.json</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Upgrade guide</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/blob/main/UPGRADE.md\">twilio's upgrade guide</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>Upgrade Guide</h1>\n<p><em>All <code>MAJOR</code> version bumps will have upgrade notes posted here.</em></p>\n<h2>[2023-01-25] 3.x.x to 4.x.x</h2>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li>Supported Node.js versions updated\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade to Node.js &gt;= 14</li>\n<li>Dropped support for Node.js &lt; 14 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/791\">#791</a>)</li>\n<li>Added support for Node.js 18 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/794\">#794</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Lazy loading enabled by default (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/752\">#752</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>Required Twilio modules now lazy load by default</li>\n<li>See the <a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/blob/main/README.md#lazy-loading\">README</a> for how to disable lazy loading</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Type changes from <code>object</code> to <code>Record</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/873\">#873</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>Certain response properties now use the <code>Record</code> type with <code>string</code> keys</li>\n<li>Including the <code>subresourceUris</code> property for v2010 APIs and the <code>links</code> properties for non-v2010 APIs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Access Tokens\n<ul>\n<li>Creating an <a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/iam/access-tokens\">AccessToken</a> requires an <code>identity</code> in the options (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/875\">#875</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ConversationsGrant</code> has been deprecated in favor of <code>VoiceGrant</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/783\">#783</a>)</li>\n<li><code>IpMessagingGrant</code> has been removed (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/784\">#784</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>TwiML function deprecations (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/twilio/twilio-node/pull/788\">#788</a>)\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/voice/twiml/refer\"><code>&lt;Refer&gt;</code></a>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Refer.referSip()</code> replaced by <code>Refer.sip()</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/voice/twiml/say/text-speech#generating-ssml-via-helper-libraries\"><code>&lt;Say&gt;</code></a>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlBreak()</code> and <code>Say.break_()</code> replaced by <code>Say.break()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlEmphasis()</code> replaced by <code>Say.emphasis()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlLang()</code> replaced by <code>Say.lang()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlP()</code> replaced by <code>Say.p()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlPhoneme()</code> replaced by <code>Say.phoneme()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlProsody()</code> replaced by <code>Say.prosody()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlS()</code> replaced by <code>Say.s()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlSayAs()</code> replaced by <code>Say.sayAs()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlSub()</code> replaced by <code>Say.sub()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Say.ssmlW()</code> replaced by <code>Say.w()</code></p>\n<p>Old:</p>\n<pre lang=\"js\"><code>const response = new VoiceResponse();\nconst say = response.say(&quot;Hello&quot;);\nsay.ssmlEmphasis(&quot;you&quot;);\n</code></pre>\n<p>New:</p>\n<pre lang=\"js\"><code>const response = new VoiceResponse();\nconst say = response.say(&quot;Hello&quot;);\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/commit/aa7a28bf1279dfd6d4430e12b6b32c16f0485c87\"><code>aa7a28b</code></a> Release 4.20.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/twilio/twilio-node/commit/a2f90eb47a8451198cd0ff79eb2ff3cfae3c4e3b\"><code>a2f90eb</code></a> [Librarian] Regenerated @ 08c0904bec7ba6e5da9e5db6c4e0f74dfc97fb10</li>\n<li><a href=\"